findings.detail:
SPEC §7 says enemies 'spend most of their time posturing'. As shipped, on average:
- 0.3-0.6 of six Punks posture in the fight acts, 1.0-1.2 in observed and 2.0-2.1 in passive;
- 2.0-2.4 are in ENGAGE, WINDUP or ATTACK;
- the rest are backing off or reacting.
So a Punk is almost always at the player's nose (P1-int call 18 measured the same and changed nothing). R12 sits on its edge:
- passive KO time 12.15-14.15 s in my runs and 11.98-16.0 s over the builder's 8 seeds (s6 at 11.98 s misses 12 s);
- the worst 2 s of damage is exactly 30, the limit, in all 14 runs.
The cadence is bound by the director's gap and grace, not the Punk, until the cooldown passes about 4 s. This is a feel default the gate is locking.

